    "text": "<p>Moles of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CoCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>mole</mtext></math></p><p>Moles of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;ions precipitated<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>22</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>23</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>mole</mtext></math></p><p>So, one mole of complex will release two moles of chloride ions so, formula of complex is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msub><mi>Cl</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><br /><br />&nbsp;</p>",
